# Scratch files this tooling writes while working in the repo.

# opencode config ships with the repo; everything else in here is scratch.
# (Listing tracked paths instead of each scratch name, because committing a
#  throwaway script by `git add -A` happened three separate times.)
/.opencode/*
!/.opencode/opencode.json
!/.opencode/plugins/
!/.opencode/skills/
